---
title: Smoked ham sandwich
tags: [pork, quick]
source: Smoked Ham Sandwich by StarChefs, https://www.starchefs.com/recipes/smoked-ham-sandwich
---

== Pistachio oil ==

Blend the @pistachio paste{} and @pistachios{} in a #blender{}. With the motor
running, pour in the @extra virgin olive oil{} slowly until smooth and
emulsified. Refrigerate in a #squeeze bottle{}.

== Sandwich ==

Split the @baguette{}(fresh) lengthwise and drizzle both cut sides with the
pistachio oil.

Layer the @ham{}(smoked, thinly sliced) and
@brie cheese{}(truffle, double cream) on the bottom half. Close and serve.
